{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":39,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["巴比倫王的使節"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那時，巴比倫王巴拉但的兒子米羅達‧巴拉但聽見希西家病而痊癒，就送書信和禮物給他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["希西家喜歡見使者，就把自己寶庫的金子、銀子、香料、貴重的膏油，和他武庫的一切軍器，並所有的財寶都給他們看；他家中和全國之內，希西家沒有一樣不給他們看的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["於是先知以賽亞來見希西家王，問他說：「這些人說甚麼？他們從哪裏來見你？」希西家說：「他們從遠方的巴比倫來見我。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["以賽亞說：「他們在你家裏看見了甚麼？」希西家說：「凡我家中所有的，他們都看見了；我財寶中沒有一樣不給他們看的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["以賽亞對希西家說：「你要聽萬軍之耶和華的話："]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["日子必到，凡你家裏所有的，並你列祖積蓄到如今的，都要被擄到巴比倫去，不留下一樣；這是耶和華說的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["並且從你本身所生的眾子，其中必有被擄去、在巴比倫王宮裏當太監的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["希西家對以賽亞說：「你所說耶和華的話甚好，因為在我的年日中必有太平和穩固的景況。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/39.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/40.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/38.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}